cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use digestome, please cite it as below."
title: "digestome: a licence-clean marker-gene panel for functional profiling of anaerobic digestion microbiomes"
abstract: >-
  A curated marker-gene panel and scorer for anaerobic digestion microbiomes, built only on
  sources that are free for commercial use (NCBIfam, public domain; Pfam, CC0; Rhea, CC BY).
  The scorer reports pathway completeness, branch capability and, for hydrolysis, whether the
  enzyme carries a domain that anchors it outside the cell. Methanogenesis routes are called
  from gene gates plus a sourced lineage policy, so reverse-methanogenesis lineages and known
  methylotrophs do not receive routes their lineage cannot support.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tpall/digestome"
keywords:
  - anaerobic digestion
  - biogas
  - metagenomics
  - marker genes
  - methanogenesis
  - HMMER
  - metagenome-assembled genomes
